 711               /      ANALOGUE TO DIGITAL CONVERSION FIXUP.
 712               
 713               /       AS SUPPLIED, FOCAL DOESN'T WORK ON CHANNEL 0 AS ON THE OTHERS, ALSO SOME
 714               /       CONVERTERS MAY NOT WORK IF MERELY DEVICE CODES ARE CHANGED. THIS IS AN
 715               /       ATTEMPT TO SOLVE THIS. ADJACENT SPACE IS USED FROM THE NO INTERRUPT OUTPUT
 716               /       ROUTINE WHICH IS NOT NEEDED TO DEBUG THE FADC FUNCTION. IF DEBUGGING IS
 717               /       DESIRED THEN PATCH THE NO INTERRUPT OUTPUT ROUTINE BACK IN AND HAVE FUN
 718               /       (WILL INTERRUPT?). THIS PATCH CAN BE CONDITIONALLY ASSEMBLED FOR AF01,
 719               /       AX08, OR AD-8/E, A CONVERTERS. CHANGE DEVICE CODES APPROPRIATELY FOR
 720               /       OTHER CONVERTERS.
