1512               /       AS WRITTEN, THE TRIGONOMETRIC FUNCTION PACKAGES ARE INTERDEPENDENT, THUS
1513               /       IT IS IMPOSSIBLE TO HAVE ATN, LOG, EXP WITHOUT SIN, COS.
1514               
1515               /       BY TAKING ADVANTAGE OF CODE OPTIMIZATION TECHNIQUES, COINCIDENCES OF
1516               /       ASSEMBLY AND SMALL HOLES IN THE AREA, THE TWO PACKAGES CAN BE SPLIT. THIS
1517               /       ALLOWS THE ATN, LOG, EXP PACKAGE TO BE SELECTED ALONE BY RELOCATING IT TO
1518               /       THE AREA FORMERLY OCCUPIED BY SIN, COS. THIS SAVES EXACTLY ONE PAGE OF
1519               /       FOCAL BUFFER SPACE.
